foundation.question_text:
What number is the arrow pointing to?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-3.4,0)--(3.4,0);
\foreach \v in {-10,...,10} {\draw (0.3*\v,0.12)--(0.3*\v,-0.12);}
\foreach \v in {-10,-5,0,5,10} {\node[below] at (0.3*\v,-0.16) {$\v$};}
\draw[-{Stealth}] (-0.9,0.62)--(-0.9,0.14);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What number is the arrow pointing to?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-3.4,0)--(3.4,0);
\foreach \v in {-10,...,10} {\draw (0.3*\v,0.12)--(0.3*\v,-0.12);}
\foreach \v in {-10,-5,0,5,10} {\node[below] at (0.3*\v,-0.16) {$\v$};}
\draw[-{Stealth}] (1.2,0.62)--(1.2,0.14);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Mark $-4$ on the number line.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-3.1,0)--(3.1,0);
\foreach \v in {-5,...,5} {\draw (0.5*\v,0.12)--(0.5*\v,-0.12); \node[below] at (0.5*\v,-0.16) {$\v$};}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

foundation.solution_text:
$-4$ is $1$ interval left of $-3$, on the left of zero.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (-3.1,0)--(3.1,0);
\foreach \v in {-5,...,5} {\draw (0.5*\v,0.12)--(0.5*\v,-0.12); \node[below] at (0.5*\v,-0.16) {$\v$};}
\fill (-2.0,0) circle (2.2pt);
\node[above] at (-2.0,0.2) {$-4$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

